// study-plan: the catalog template for the study-plan unit. `skills install`
// validates it, spells every default out and writes it as the unit's
// `sandbox.jsonc`; `sandboxes/study-plan.md` is its help prose.
{
  "v": 2,
  "kind": "skill",
  "stages": {
    // The scheduled evening run, with nobody at the keyboard. No host: the
    // harness profile supplies the model hosts.
    "routine": {
      "extends": "routine",
      "filesystem": {
        // Each tree by name: a bare $WORKDIR grants nothing. `sources/` holds
        // the syllabus, `research/` the quiz logs. The `study-plan` and `quiz`
        // overlays are `_base`'s `$OPS/policy` read, so they need no entry.
        "read": [
          "$WORKDIR/research",
          "$WORKDIR/sources"
        ],
        // `wiki/` alone: the units the plan embeds are read there, and the
        // plan and the exam guides are written there.
        "allow": ["$WORKDIR/wiki"]
      }
    }
  }
}
